    "model": "John Lennon was born in Liverpool on 9 October 1940 and formed the Quarrymen in 1957, which later developed into The Beatles. The Beatles' appearance on The Ed Sullivan Show on 9 February 1964 gave them a mass audience in the USA. In 1969 Lennon and Yoko Ono promoted peace during a bed-in in Amsterdam, and his song Give Peace a Chance became an anthem of the anti-war movement. He was shot dead in New York on 8 December 1980, and his death was widely mourned across Europe and America.",
