    "label": "3(a)",
    "marks": 10,
    "model": "Yes, Johnson exaggerates in Document A.\nHe claims that leaving Vietnam would start World War III, which overstates the danger, as the war in Vietnam never led to a world war.\nHe says that if he left Vietnam he could accomplish nothing for anybody anywhere on the entire globe, which overstates how much his global influence would suffer.",
