    "model": "Judgement: Document B is the more objective source.\nDocument A: King was a leader of the boycott and wrote this memoir later, so his personal view and enthusiasm, such as calling it a miracle, colour his account.\nDocument B: Joe Azbell reported from the scene on the same day and gave specific details such as the time and the silent crowd, though his comparison to a football game shows some outside bias.",
