    "model": "Ho Chi Minh was born Nguyen Sinh Cung in 1890 in central Vietnam and spent about thirty years abroad before returning. He founded the Viet Minh in May 1941 to win independence from the French and the Japanese. On 2 September 1945 he proclaimed the Democratic Republic of Vietnam in Hanoi, quoting the United States Declaration of Independence. He then led the government through the First Indochina War against France, which ended with the Geneva Accords of 1954.",
