    "model": "John Lennon's band The Beatles appeared on The Ed Sullivan Show on 9 February 1964, which gave them a mass audience in the USA. His song Give Peace a Chance became an anthem of the anti-war movement after he and Yoko Ono held a peace bed-in at the Amsterdam Hilton in March 1969. In November 1969 he returned his MBE to protest British support for the United States in Vietnam. Lennon was shot dead in New York on 8 December 1980, and his death was widely mourned across Europe and America.",
