    "label": "2(a)",
    "marks": 10,
    "model": "Yes, both documents suggest the Congo is a dangerous place.\nDocument A shows a Congolese man with a knife cutting a rope above a river, with a crocodile waiting below the Belgian.\nDocument B describes the Congolese soldiers as disorderly and mutinous, and the Belgian paratroopers as arrogant and trigger-happy.",
