    "model": "Clemens Metternich was a Rhineland aristocrat who guided Habsburg foreign policy from 1809 to 1848. He dominated the Congress of Vienna in 1814-15 and worked to restore the old order. He drafted the Carlsbad Decrees in 1819, which banned student fraternities and imposed press censorship. He used the congresses of Troppau and Laibach to send Austrian troops into Italy to crush revolts in 1821. He was forced to resign in March 1848 and fled to England.",
