    "model": "The great open space before the high altar was divided into sections and sub-sections marked by letters and numbers.\nThese sections were assigned to particular groups, countries, dioceses and parishes.\nArchbishop Michael Curley, an Irishman, was chosen to celebrate the Mass.\nA world-renowned Irish tenor, John Count McCormack, was chosen to sing, which shows attention to detail.",
