    "marks": 10,
    "model": "Document B gives the clearer idea of what happened at a Nuremberg Rally.\nDocument A mainly comments on Hitler's appeal to the crowd and the devotion of the Germans, with little description of the event itself.\nDocument B describes the burning urns, the searchlights and the solemn drumming, the crowd growing restless as Hitler's black cars arrived, and people swaying in a frenzy and weeping as he spoke.",
