    "model": "Karl Marx was born in Trier in 1818 and became editor of the Rheinische Zeitung in Cologne in 1842. He held that class struggle drives history and that capitalism would be overthrown by the working class. With Friedrich Engels he wrote the Communist Manifesto, published in London in February 1848. In 1864 Marx helped to found the International Workingmen's Association, and the first volume of Das Kapital appeared in 1867.",
